## Summary

I built an articulated **jar of coffee beans** (`coffee_bean_jar`), authored in the y-up / +z-forward frame and fitted to the constraint box.

**Structure (3 parts):**
- **`jar`** (root): a genuinely hollow, open-topped glass vessel built by revolving a closed `(radius, height)` cross-section — real 4 mm walls and a solid glass base, with a light translucent glass material.
